X: 1
T: Somewhere That's Green
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: Audrey's ballad from Little Shop of Horrors. Melody (channel 0) of a
N: hamienet.com MIDI (id 7936), moved down a fifth from G major to C so the range
N: fits the recorder; chords fitted from the MIDI's accompaniment. Form as in the
N: source: the verse twice (repeat marks; the second pass's pickup sits inside
N: them), the bridge, the verse again and the tag. Held notes the sequencer cut
N: short are sustained to the next onset; the bridge's Ab and Bb7 are the source's
N: bVI-bVII lift.
